---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Governance — Xhavic"
  description="On-chain governance with no off-chain backdoors. DAO structure controlling protocol upgrades, sequencer policies, oracle parameters, and treasury."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-dark text-white" style="padding:6rem 0 5rem;" data-reveal>
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width:720px;">
        <p class="label-mono-dark" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Governance</p>
        <h1 class="heading-display" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
          On-chain governance.<br />No off-chain backdoors.
        </h1>
        <p class="prose-editorial-dark" style="margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
          The Xhavic governance layer is a DAO structure with on-chain proposal execution.
          No multisig can override governance decisions. No off-chain committee can veto
          on-chain votes. The protocol is governed by its token holders.
        </p>
        <a href="/docs" class="btn-primary">Read Governance Docs</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DAO Structure -->
  <div class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="container" style="max-width:1000px;">
      <p class="label-mono" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Structure</p>
      <h2 class="heading-section" style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">DAO Structure</h2>
      <p class="prose-editorial" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
        Governance is organized as a decentralized autonomous organization with on-chain
        proposal submission, voting, and execution. No component of the governance system
        operates off-chain.
      </p>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <!-- Proposal Lifecycle -->
        <div class="card-arch">
          <h3 style="font-weight:700;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Proposal Lifecycle</h3>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25rem;">
            {[
              { step: '01', label: 'Submission', desc: 'Any token holder meeting the proposal threshold can submit a governance proposal on-chain.' },
              { step: '02', label: 'Discussion Period', desc: 'A fixed period for community review and analysis before voting begins.' },
              { step: '03', label: 'Voting', desc: 'Token-weighted voting. One token, one vote. No delegation to off-chain entities.' },
              { step: '04', label: 'Execution', desc: 'Approved proposals execute on-chain automatically. No manual intervention required.' },
            ].map((item) => (
              <div style="display:flex;gap:0.75rem;">
                <span class="label-mono" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;">{item.step}</span>
                <div>
                  <h4 style="font-weight:600;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:2px;">{item.label}</h4>
                  <p style="font-size:14px;color:#737373;line-height:1.6;">{item.desc}</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Design Principles -->
        <div class="card-arch">
          <h3 style="font-weight:700;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Design Principles</h3>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;">
            {[
              'All governance actions execute on-chain. No off-chain multisig can override a passed proposal.',
              'Proposal code is the proposal. What is voted on is what executes — no interpretation layer.',
              'Voting power is proportional to token holdings. No special classes of votes or veto rights.',
              'Timelock delays between approval and execution allow the community to respond to malicious proposals.',
              'The governance contract itself is upgradeable only through governance.',
            ].map((item) => (
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.625rem;">
                <span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:#000;margin-top:8px;flex-shrink:0;"></span>
                <p style="font-size:14px;color:#737373;line-height:1.6;">{item}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#a3a3a3;margin-top:2rem;font-style:italic;">
        Source: XHAVIC Technical Whitepaper v1.0, Section 13 — Governance Architecture
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Four Governance Domains -->
  <div class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="container" style="max-width:960px;">
      <p class="label-mono" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Domains</p>
      <h2 class="heading-section" style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Four Governance Domains</h2>
      <p class="prose-editorial" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
        Governance authority is organized into four distinct domains. Each domain
        has independent proposal and voting processes.
      </p>
      <div class="grid-2" data-reveal-stagger>
        <div class="card-arch">
          <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Protocol Upgrades</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:#737373;line-height:1.7;">
            Changes to the execution layer, smart contract upgrades, new precompile addresses,
            and modifications to the core protocol logic. Requires supermajority approval.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-arch">
          <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Sequencer Policies</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:#737373;line-height:1.7;">
            Block time parameters, batch submission windows, MEV protection settings,
            and sequencer rotation rules. Controls how transactions are ordered and submitted.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-arch">
          <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Oracle Parameters</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:#737373;line-height:1.7;">
            Data source configuration, quorum thresholds, freshness requirements,
            and new price feed additions. Controls the native oracle infrastructure.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-arch">
          <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Treasury</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:#737373;line-height:1.7;">
            Protocol treasury allocation, grant funding, ecosystem development budgets,
            and fee distribution parameters. All treasury movements are on-chain.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Progressive Decentralization -->
  <div class="section-inset" data-reveal>
    <div class="container" style="max-width:960px;">
      <p class="label-mono-dark" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Timeline</p>
      <h2 class="heading-section" style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Progressive Decentralization</h2>
      <p class="prose-editorial-dark" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
        Governance does not launch fully decentralized. The roadmap moves from
        constrained initial governance to full DAO control.
      </p>

      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.5rem;" data-reveal-stagger>
        <!-- Phase I -->
        <div class="card-dark-solid" style="position:relative;">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;">Phase I — Foundation</h3>
            <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(34,98,255,0.15);color:#2262ff;">Current</span>
          </div>
          <span class="label-mono-dark" style="display:block;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Launch</span>
          <ul style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;">
            {[
              'Permissioned sequencer operated by the core team',
              'Governance contracts deployed but with limited scope',
              'Community feedback channels active',
              'Token distribution and initial staking',
            ].map((item) => (
              <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">
                <span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);margin-top:7px;flex-shrink:0;"></span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase II -->
        <div class="card-dark-solid">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;">Phase II — Activation</h3>
            <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">Planned</span>
          </div>
          <span class="label-mono-dark" style="display:block;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Q3-Q4 2026</span>
          <ul style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;">
            {[
              'Full DAO governance activated across all four domains',
              'Multi-sequencer rotation governed by token holders',
              'Treasury governance live',
              'On-chain proposal execution enabled',
            ].map((item) => (
              <li style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">
                <span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.2);margin-top:7px;flex-shrink:0;"></span>
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Phase III -->
        <div class="card-dark-solid">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem;margin-bottom:1rem;">
            <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;">Phase III — Maturity</h3>
            <span style="font-size:11px;font-weight:600;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">Planned</span>
          </div>
          <span class="label-mono-dark" style="display:block;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">2027+</span>
          <div class="grid-2" style="gap:0.5rem;">
            {[
              'All protocol parameters governed by DAO',
              'No admin keys or emergency multisig',
              'Cross-domain governance coordination',
              'Governance contract upgrades via governance itself',
            ].map((item) => (
              <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0.5rem;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">
                <span style="width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);margin-top:7px;flex-shrink:0;"></span>
                {item}
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p style="text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3);font-style:italic;margin-top:2rem;">
        Source: XHAVIC Technical Whitepaper v1.0, Section 13. Timelines are targets and subject to change.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Light break before CTA -->
  <div class="section-bordered" data-reveal>
    <div class="container" style="max-width:640px;text-align:center;">
      <p class="label-mono" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Participate</p>
      <h2 class="heading-section" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Learn More About Governance</h2>
      <p class="prose-editorial" style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;margin-bottom:2.5rem;">
        The governance documentation covers proposal formats, voting mechanics,
        domain-specific parameters, and the progressive decentralization timeline.
      </p>
      <a href="/docs" class="btn-primary">
        Read Governance Docs
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>import '../scripts/reveal.ts';</script>
</BaseLayout>
